    "body": "\nHi Valentina,\n\nHope you\u2019re doing well! I wanted to share a bit more context\u2014I recently received an offer for a coding agent research team at Microsoft. Just want to clarify that I\u2019m still really excited about Adobe and fully planning to stick with it!\n\nSince I\u2019m also hoping to do a fall/spring internship this year, Lydia suggested it might be okay to check in with you about the timing for Adobe. Totally understand if summer is the main focus, but I thought I\u2019d mention it\u2014it would be great to explore both if possible, though no worries either way!\n\nThanks so much,\nJenny\n\n\n \nHi Christian and Carmen,\n\nThank you so much for the offer and for all the time and care the team put into the process, and answering all my questions. I was genuinely excited about the work you guys do and how aligned we are and the chance to collaborate with the team and honestly it was one of my favorite interviews ever, which made this a very difficult decision.\n\nAfter a lot of thought, I\u2019ve decided to move forward with a prior commitment with Adobe that I had already signed before receiving this interview. This was not an easy choice at all and I spent so long deliberating it. I want to emphasize how much I appreciate the opportunity and how strongly I felt about the team and the research direction.\n\nIf there are any opportunities in the fall or spring, I would be extremely interested in staying in touch and would be thrilled to explore the possibility of interning with Microsoft then. I would love to work with you guys. \n\nThank you again for your understanding. I truly hope our paths cross again soon.\n\nBest regards,\nJenny\n\n\nHi Valentina,\n\nYeah for more context, I just received a summer offer for a coding agent research team. I wanted to see if there was a way I would be able to fit both in this year (since I want to do a fall/spring internship this year) and Lydia mentioned it wouldn\u2019t hurt to ask. I totally understand that you prefer summer internships, I just wanted to check to see if doing both would be possible. I\u2019m planning on sticking with Adobe anyways since I\u2019m really excited about it :) \n\nThanks, \nJenny \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHi Valentina,\n\nYeah for more context, I just received a summer offer for MSR\u2019s agent research team (I had applied at the same time and they just got back to me). I just wanted to see if there was a way I could be able to fit both in my schedule since I plan on trying to do a fall or spring internship anyways this year. I talked with Lydia who said it wouldn\u2019t hurt to ask. I totally understand if you prefer summer internships, but I just wanted to check to see if it\u2019d be possible/there was any flexibility. I\u2019m planning on sticking with Adobe anyways since I\u2019m really excited about it :) \n\nThanks, \nJenny \n\n\n\nHi Valentina!\n\nGot it! Yeah for more context, I was just trying to plan my summer and blah blah. Happy to just intern for the summer ! Sorry for the hassle ",
