    "id": "f1467d29-8b4c-4c35-9300-93c8a29abacd",
    "title": "2025 recap",
    "body": "Year of self protection! \n\nPayoff of the hard work in research from 2024 and trying to figure out what\u2019s next career wise \n\nstarted to really trying to process an interpersonally traumatic 2024 and reevaluate why I keep putting ppl above me when they don\u2019t appreciate or really see me, decided to continuously try to protect my energy more and work through my self-sacrificing behavior \n\nFeeling a better sense of stability and learning to release control/ manage conflict better through my relationship \n\nJanuary \n- conference in Hawaii! I love the beach I need to settle down near a beach \n- began realizing how my mental health slides when I\u2019m at home\n- Still feeling incredibly lonely and recovering from 2024\n\nFebruary\n- struggling with feeling a sense of non-belonging n ppl that align w my fundamental morals \n- Trying to depend on my siblings more for support \n\nMarch\n- had bad habits of overgiving and not realizing it\n- Had no life outside of work lol \n- Felt like I was getting trapped in unhealthy dynamics but also didn\u2019t know what to do bc it didn\u2019t seem like I could meet people that would actually vibe with me so I brushed my feelings away and didn\u2019t change my behavior \n\nApril\n- Finally got to enjoy nyc after paper submission and run around town \n- Greek Easter\n- went to CHI! First paper was a success and felt like my work was paying off \n\nMay\n- Continued travelling to Japan with Tao and my sister!! So chill and nice \n- Went to see my grandpa and extended family in China and was emo about being away from them (I promised myself to take advantage of being a student as much as possible and come back often)\n- Realized at how bad I am at noticing I something is wrong and how it\u2019s usually too late bc I doubt my intuition\n\nJune\n- spent the summer in the bay before the phd!\n- Went to SD w hs friends!\n- Told my advisor I wanted to learn how to develop my own ideas from scratch \n- Realized the depth at which *childhood trauma* is the cause for me to absorb blame and overgive and end up in bad situations \n- Mental health slid after fat triggers \n- First couples trip with Nikos to mammoth lakes where I drove entire time\n\nJuly \n- decided I need to stand up for myself and actively tried to remove myself from bad situations \n- Went to Tahoe and rafting for July 4th! \n- Had many mental breakdowns reliving past interpersonal conflicts, also trauma dumped it all over nikos lol\n- got to hang out w the friends in the bay! And hang out w grandparents and bonded w my grandpa abt research \n- Decided to heavily explore and prioritize hobbies like art, vlogging, painting, music in the future \n\nAugust\n- went to Greece to meet Nikos family! I have loved Greece ever since 6th grade and now I feel like I manifested it \n- Came back to nyc and had panic attacks of feeling like I couldn\u2019t rely on anyone\n- Trying to be intentional of what type of friends I want to make and the type of community I want to build\n\nSeptember \n- met friends who matched my energy better and I didn\u2019t feel like I was over exerting myself into forcing square into a circle\n- Started PhD officially and trying to navigate around my advisor lol\n- Put way too much pressure on myself and forgot why I liked research to begin with \n- Began doing a lot more self care as a form of self soothing\n\nOctober \n- Continued to put unnecessary pressure on myself and hold myself to an insane standard work-wise\n- Beat myself up over situations bc of self-doubt\n- Became too codependent because I was so scared \n- Burnt out like crazy\n\nNovember\n- tried to make mental shift again to spend more time alone\n- still doubted myself and my decisions a lot but felt more validated about my gut intuitions (but I shouldn\u2019t have to wait for external validation for me to feel some type of way!)\n- Felt more healthy but still prone to panic attacks and not even realizing something is triggering me \n- Relationship with work was changing for the better again although still in the gutter \n- Many double dates!! Happy to find double date situations \n\nDecember \n- Validated that the situation I was trying to leave was worth leaving and that I need to trust my intuition \n- Tryna fuckin push thru some panic attacks, learning to regulate by waiting until my heart rate comes down to take my thoughts seriously\n- Trying to figure out what\u2019s fair vs not and what i can reasonably expect of myself and others \n- Instinctively operated from a place of scarcity/low self esteem again bc my mental health slides at home lol \n- Went to Taiwan before going back to motherland to hang out w my extended family fam!  \n\nOverall I had to confront of a lot of things with myself this year and shed behavior that was not serving me! Ongoing process :) \n\nnext year I want to manage my anxiety and ocd a lot better and let things go (as a form of taking care of myself) without trying to control the future.  Continuing to be more intentional/practice self care and I start to work through some of my resentments so I can exist with more peace and safety. I want to trust more with people who show me they\u2019ve trust worthy instead of letting the past fuck shit up and build a stronger community and get better at communicating things I dislike ",
